      "message": "1. As this is default AOSP behaviour, there is no reason to not follow it.\n2. Newer f2fs-tools already enable project_quota by default (android-14.0.0 branches already include this change). From mkfs.f2fs man page:\n```\n-g default-options\n\n    Use a default set of options. The following values are supported:\n\n    android\n\n        Use default options for Android having \"-d1 -f -w 4096 -R 0:0 -O encrypt -O project_quota,extra_attr,{quota} -O verity\".\n```\n3. If we can simply the logic without harming anything, what\u0027s wrong with it?",
